            <ArticleTitle>Hit to lead SAR study on benzoxazole derivatives for an NPY Y5 antagonist.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>2020-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.bmcl.2012.01.027</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a hit to lead study on a novel benzoxazole NPY Y5 antagonist. Starting from HTS hit 1, structure-activity relationships were developed. Compound 12 showed reduction of food intake and a tendency to suppress body weight gain over the 21-day experimental period.</AbstractText>
